  "title": "5 Slash Commands That Make Claude Instantly Better",
  "description": "Five slash commands worth setting up in Claude. /human strips every AI tell out of your writing. /mirror plays back the picture Claude has built of you. /redteam attacks your own plan so you find the holes before you launch. /forecast maps what each option turns into. /concise kills the filler.\n\nThese are custom commands, which means you create them once and they work forever. The full guide includes 15 finished commands you can copy, plus the exact setup for both the terminal and the Claude app.\n\nGet all 15 commands here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Qpm-F6O3F37DtuWQLmBBq08is2JND7E7ca6CjZ8Zf-U/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #PromptEngineering",
